source('worldbank-tarbela','世界銀行塔貝拉第四擴建資料','World Bank Tarbela fourth extension factsheet','World Bank','https://www.worldbank.org/en/news/factsheet/2020/02/25/tarbela-fourth-hydropower-extension-project-t4hp','2020年原始計畫頁核實1976年壩完工、灌溉防洪發電用途及2012年第四擴建批准；不採內文相互不符的早期機組加總。','The2020 primary project factsheet verifies1976 dam completion, irrigation/flood/power purposes and2012 fourth-extension approval; inconsistent early unit arithmetic is excluded.')
