source('zra-gates','卡里巴溢洪閘門修復業主說明','Kariba spillway refurbishment owner description','Zambezi River Authority','https://www.zambezira.org/kdrp/spillway-refurbishment','已讀六孔閘門、混凝土變形影響啟閉與備援隔水概念；頁內過時採購預計不作實際施工結論。','Read the six-gate configuration, concrete-deformation operating concern and backup-isolation concept; outdated procurement forecasts are not treated as achieved work.')
